  unitName: Avenging Angel Blink (EU)
  unitId: 750157
  unitNumber: 7101
  description: "Plumatachi was everything to Blink. Had Blink and Plumatachi\u2019s
    roles been reversed during Coal Cauldron\u2019s attack, history would have been
    quite different. Plumatachi would have lost her life instead of Blink. Consumed
    by grief, Blink would have dedicated her body and soul to avenging her, dismantling
    her motorcycle to create a prosthesis in order to replace the limb she lost during
    Coal Cauldron\u2019s attack. She would have used Techs to create new weapons
    meant to kill everyone who participated in the attack."
  summonDesc: 
  fusionDesc: "Crushing Coal\u2019s band is the only thing left for me to do now,
    and I\u2019ll need all the help I can get."
  evoDesc: "I\u2019ll avenge you, my love!"
  element: 5
  rarity: 0
